{"id":"b5b9f71b20826f2d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-baire-property.md","title":"Baire Property","display":"df-baire-property — Baire Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-baire-property","aliases":["58-df-baire-property","58-df-baire","Baire Property"],"display":"df-baire-property — Baire Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-topology]]","[[58-df-symdiff]]","[[58-df-meager]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-baire-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-baire-property</span><span>58-df-baire</span><span>Baire Property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-baire-property — Baire Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"265554ef41cb1eca\" href=\"?note=265554ef41cb1eca\" title=\"58-df-symdiff\">58-df-symdiff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"58-df-meager\">58-df-meager</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(A,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Meager}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Meager}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d816c9cae96d1191\" href=\"?note=d816c9cae96d1191\" title=\"58-df-meager\">58-df-meager</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BP}_S,\\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BP}_S,\\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{BP}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Meager}(A\\triangle U,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{BP}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\mathrm{Meager}(A\\triangle U,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}property\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BP}_S(A,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}property\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{BaireProperty}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BP}_S(A,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The meager family is fixed by the topology; it is no longer an arbitrary family that could make every subset satisfy the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":""